# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 supplemental dayPeriodRuleSet for
# locale hi (cldr-json 47.0.0, cldr-core/supplemental/dayPeriods.json),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as the afternoon band.
# Surface: the CLDR dayPeriod name; en.wiktionary.org, entry “दोपहर”,
# glosses it “afternoon, midday”.
दोपहर
